## Original Content
<p style="text-align: center;"><img alt="当地时间4日凌晨，李在明支持者们聚集在国会前等待计票结果。人民网 柳美铉摄" height="451" src="/NMediaFile/2025/0604/MAIN1748998400707PSHWTVD4SV.jpg" width="800" /></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span>当地时间4日凌晨，李在明支持者们聚集在国会前等待计票结果。人民网 柳美铉摄</span></p> <p style="text-indent: 2em;">人民网首尔6月4日电 （周玉波、李美玉） 韩国中央选举管理委员会6月4日通过大选计票结果，正式确认共同民主党候选人李在明当选第21届韩国总统，李在明的总统任期自当地时间4日6时21分正式开启。</p> <p style="text-indent: 2em;">韩国中央选举委员会于当地时间4日7时10分左右向第21届总统大选当选人李在明的代理人、共同民主党党鞭朴赞大颁发当选证。</p> <p style="text-indent: 2em;">4日凌晨，在大选计票期间，李在明来到位于首尔汝矣岛的国会前发表讲话，对国民表示感谢。李在明表示，将全力以赴重振经济、恢复民生对话沟通。他还表示，将通过朝韩对话，寻求共存及共同繁荣之路。</p> <p style="text-indent: 2em;">韩国行政安全部表示，第21届总统李在明的宣誓就职仪式将于当地时间4日11时在国会举行。</p> <p style="text-indent: 2em;">根据计票结果，共同民主党候选人李在明的得票率为49.42%（1728.75万张），国民力量党候选人金文洙和改革新党候选人李俊锡的得票率分别为41.15%和8.34%。</p> <p style="text-indent: 2em;">本届选举是韩国自1987年宪政改革以来第二次在总统缺位情况下选举总统，当选总统无交接期，在选举结果正式确定后立即履职。</p>

## Summary
Lee Jae-myung, the candidate from the Democratic Party of Korea, has been officially elected as the 21st President of South Korea with 49.42% of the vote. His presidency began immediately after the election results were confirmed on June 4th, focusing on economic recovery, public dialogue, and inter-Korean cooperation.

## Key Points
- Lee Jae-myung won the presidential election with a significant lead, defeating candidates from the People Power Party and Reform Party.
- The presidency started without a transition period, marking the second time since 1987 that a president was elected during an absence.
- He emphasized commitments to economic revitalization, restoring public communication, and pursuing co-prosperity with North Korea through dialogue.
- The election results were confirmed by the National Election Commission, and his inauguration ceremony is scheduled for the same day.
- The election highlights ongoing political dynamics in South Korea, with multiple parties competing.


